+
+//AI(W906-GB-P2c) 20260926: gate G12 lifted -- bP65QAING added to cmydef (P2c, golden 912 cmydef.cpp:6017); its setters (atester / csystem) come with P2b, so it reads false until then -- golden main.cpp:19037-19040
